{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"issues\":[{\"sec\":\"S05\",\"screen\":\"不是想通了，而是抵抗得累了\",\"source\":\"这一下松动，也像是“不是已经想通了，而是抵抗得累了”。\",\"type\":2,\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿将其保留为一种可能的感受，屏幕稿却把这种解释写成了确定结论。\"},{\"sec\":\"S10\",\"screen\":\"问题又递回来：我究竟要怎样继续生活\",\"source\":\"如果把这次回返听成心理上的回望，开头的试探姿态仿佛把问题重新递回来：“那么，我究竟要怎样继续生活？”\",\"type\":2,\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿明确限定为一种听法，并用“仿佛”保留不确定性，屏幕稿则直接断定问题已经递回来。\"},{\"sec\":\"S10\",\"screen\":\"往事明明重要，他却已经累得没力气把它重新讲一遍\",\"source\":\"这些轻弱、零碎的声音，也像一个疲倦的人在回想一件往事：明明知道它很重要，却已经没有力气把它重新讲述一遍。\",\"type\":6,\"severity\":\"严重\",\"why\":\"定稿只是把音乐比作一个疲倦的人回忆往事，屏幕稿却把无力复述的状态直接安到了他身上，容易让观众误以为这是他真实经历的心理状态。\"}]}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "84ee29b4-bbdd-4c2b-8299-34c8e96bfe8a", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261109T014046622889Z", "elapsed_seconds": 225.641, "completed_utc": "2026-11-09T01:44:32.276265+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "02d76641ba343d668fa12ecdab4ebb2c5514b088c1bd3b3825b1c791bd1289f6", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd